        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about">
        <div class="section-title">More about Me</div>
        <div class="facts-container">
          <article class="fact-card">
            <h2 class="fact-title">Beloved Singer and Song-Writer</h2>
            <p class="fact-description" style="--radius:4px;">
              I am beloved world-wide as a singer and song-writer, my most
