            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <h1>Why I scream so much</h1>
      <h2>
        My blood pressure is 139/89, which is why I shout more. I have no plans
        to address this.
      </h2>
      <hr /><br />
      <hr /><br />
      <hr /><br />
      <hr /><br />
      <hr /><br />
      <h1>Employment status</h1>
      <h2>I am drunk and unimployed. Please hire me.</h2>

      <div id="map"></div>

      <h1>IMPORANT NOTE! I AM NOW DIVORCED!</h1>
      <h2>
        As of 2026/9/3 My bitch wife Cynthia divorced me because "I shouldn't
