      </h2>

      <footer style="text-align:center; padding-top:3rem;">
        <p>
          Graig's Website &copy; All Rights Reserved<br /><small
            >This site was last updated November 16, 2023.</small
          >
        </p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
